.TH pcx-render 1  "pcx 0.1.3"
.SH NAME
pcx\-render \- Render one MCAP Point Frame or PCD, LAS, or LAZ Static Cloud to stdout
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpcx render\fR [\fB\-\-topic\fR] [\fB\-\-frame\fR] [\fB\-\-at\fR] [\fB\-\-backend\fR] [\fB\-\-width\fR] [\fB\-\-height\fR] [\fB\-\-palette\-limit\fR] [\fB\-\-payload\-limit\fR] [\fB\-\-memory\-limit\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIINPUT\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Render one MCAP Point Frame or PCD, LAS, or LAZ Static Cloud to stdout
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-topic\fR \fI<TOPIC>\fR
MCAP Topic whose messages are counted as Point Frames
.TP
\fB\-\-frame\fR \fI<INDEX>\fR
Zero\-based Point Frame index after Topic selection
.TP
\fB\-\-at\fR \fI<DURATION>\fR
First Point Frame at or after this duration from recording start
.TP
\fB\-\-backend\fR \fI<BACKEND>\fR [default: auto]
Terminal backend, selected conservatively by default
.br

.br
[\fIpossible values: \fRauto, unicode, kitty, sixel]
.TP
\fB\-\-width\fR \fI<PIXELS>\fR [default: 80]
Projection raster width in pixels
.TP
\fB\-\-height\fR \fI<PIXELS>\fR [default: 48]
Projection raster height in pixels
.TP
\fB\-\-palette\-limit\fR \fI<COLORS>\fR [default: 256]
Maximum Sixel palette size
.TP
\fB\-\-payload\-limit\fR \fI<BYTES>\fR [default: 67108864]
Maximum encoded Kitty or Sixel payload bytes
.TP
\fB\-\-memory\-limit\fR \fI<BYTES>\fR [default: 536870912]
Hard managed\-memory limit in bytes
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIINPUT\fR>
MCAP Point Frame or PCD, LAS, or LAZ Static Cloud Source
